(* Original off-cut four-vector amplitude inputs. This fixture contains no
   compact target or expected simplifier answer. Parameter atoms are inert
   inside the payload, so the same fixture can be used with any model scope.

   Usage after loading HEPCAT:
     inputs = Get[path][ModelParameter[model, #] &];
   An Association mapping parameter names to values is accepted too.
   SourceBaselineScore records the numerator-momentum-weighted input score. *)

